      "translationZh": "修改了 --bare 参数的行为，使其仅连接命令行中指定的 MCP 服务器，不发送系统提醒，且不启动任何后台任务；在 --bare 模式下，达到超时限制的 shell 命令现在会停止运行，而不是转入后台",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "001f3869fd894b19",
      "translationZh": "修改了发送键 (ctrl+enter) 的功能，使其将技能自身的 shell 命令转入后台运行，而不是结束该命令",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65e674bfa78c9f0b",
      "translationZh": "修改了 WebFetch 因域名频率限制安全检查而产生的错误提示，以告知 Claude 不要进行循环重试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16507f781b1df559",
      "translationZh": "修改了插件安装机制，拒绝安装 git 仓库或文件夹形式的 npm 源，并且仅从注册表包中安装插件依赖",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e14df6e8d771925",
      "translationZh": "修改了列表界面（/artifacts, /mcp, /skills, /hooks 等），使其在名称之后始终将每一行的详细信息对齐在同一列中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f2eb146d673d374",
      "translationZh": "修改了列表的溢出行显示方式，将 \"N more above\" / \"N more below\" 改为 \"↑ N more\" / \"↓ N more\"",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ec1db0780fc217a",
      "translationZh": "修改了 /hooks 命令，使其打开后按事件分组显示已配置的钩子列表，这样查看单个钩子只需按一次 Enter 键，而不再需要三次",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d466afa739dd7436",
      "translationZh": "修改了主题选择器，将其改为适应终端的滚动列表，而不是将预览推离屏幕；数字键不再用于选择主题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d91b9dafbe91e52c",
      "translationZh": "更改了 /exit 's Remove worktree 的执行顺序，使其在 Claude Code 停止其启动的服务器和 shell 之后运行，因为在 Windows 上，这可能会导致文件夹无法被删除",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bd30b58426644d1",
      "translationZh": "更改了 claude-api skill 的 Managed Agents 示例，以创建具有受限网络环境的实例",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95e2541d480c4b41",
      "translationZh": "从 /ultrareview 和 claude ultrareview 输出中移除了浏览器链接",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de44ab00f8f8b5b6",
      "translationZh": "Windows：修复了当信任记录以不同的字母大小写保存时，claude --bg 和 agents 视图拒绝已受 Claude 信任的文件夹的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5df3c498dce4a622",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 添加了书签功能：保存 Claude 的回复并将其保留在书签侧边栏视图中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e314d543e090f7fc",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将 Claude 提出的问题和您的回答添加到对话中：在您回答问题卡片后，Questions 行会显示每个问题及其对应的选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4bf025235f670ef7",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 在聊天面板的问题卡片中添加了选项预览：所选选项的模拟效果或代码片段会显示在选项旁边或下方",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dc5691c8360196f",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 在消息下方添加了行，可展开查看终端输出、浏览器标签页、浏览器指令以及随消息发送的选定代码",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e74eedfe516748a",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了当对话已在侧边栏打开时，会在标签页中再次打开第二个对话副本的问题；现在侧边栏会自动切换到该对话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c67ad80df953462",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了当 Claude Code 输出超过 1 MB 时，设置对话框在未重新检查的情况下报告保存失败的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0667d3fe9f117b03",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了当扩展停止响应时，出现无休止的“Teleporting session...”加载动画的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b83b3fd1bef897d5",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 改进了管理插件对话框：现在会说明由于其他设置导致已关闭的插件仍处于开启状态，并解释了插件文件夹冲突的情况",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64abc42c34dc57e1",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将“停止”和“退出”更改为仅结束当前轮次；后台代理将继续运行，并可以从代理地图中逐个停止",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ffe2baeae3926f9",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将“✻ Claude Code”状态栏项目更改为在每个窗口中显示，以便在没有打开文件时也能打开 Claude",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e33ec3784d0f015c",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了在 Claude 发送消息后会话进入空闲状态时，已回答的问题卡片或已批准的工具调用无法收到回复的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b0b5a53b33dfbfe",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了在管理员设置中清除组织环境的设置脚本后，新的云会话仍在使用旧脚本运行的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37965a2782dc0433",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了自托管环境管理页面上的 Runner 操作菜单在打开几秒钟后会自动关闭的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d0722e471ac71fe",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了云会话从未启动的常规运行（routine runs）在运行面板、常规页面和侧边栏中显示为“成功”的问题；现在它们会显示为“失败”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a38f95bb7b4edc94",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了在云会话的输出卡片中点击音频或视频文件时，会打开一个空文件搜索界面而不是播放文件的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40cf5c9239505325",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修改了常规页面逻辑：当计划运行延迟且尚未开始时，页面将显示“应于”及计划时间，而不是显示一个过去的时间",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
